sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two planes cut one another, then their intersection is a straight line.
----
proof:

Let two planes *AB* and *BC* cut one another, and let the line *DB* be their intersection.

<figure class="diagram rdiagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="260" height="290" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="XI.3 diagram" src="propXI3.gif"/></noscript>
